    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672820/extras/fecbf9b5ed41bb8445b65e8301db70a4.webp?t=1745521359\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GleanBound</strong>: is first-person horror semi-realistic maze runner that mixes adrenaline-fueled chase mechanics with  creepy events and terrifying creatures. Collect soul stones and stay ahead of what\u2019s hunting you \u2014 but remember, every corner could be your last. Run and uncover the dark secret that put you there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672820/extras/f65ff5f1034e361e6b9fcdc3cf0f2e0d.poster.avif?t=1745521359\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672820/extras/f65ff5f1034e361e6b9fcdc3cf0f2e0d.webm?t=1745521359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672820/extras/84d627f721a2e7b1694ed6a666acb6e1.webp?t=1745521359\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world may not be fully real, but it <i>feels</i> disturbingly close.</strong>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000 The corn maze breathes with eerie atmosphere \u2014 rustling leaves, distant footsteps, flickers in the dark.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The basement reeks of decay \u2014 rotting wood, rusted tools, and walls clawed bare through torn, moldy wallpaper. Dust chokes the air, light barely reaches the corners.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019re not here to hide \u2014 you\u2019re here to run.</strong>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000 \u3000\u3000\u3000 You need to collect soul stones while something else chases you. Every second counts. One wrong turn, one missed step, and it\u2019s over. You\u2019ll either adapt to the tempo \u2014 or get swallowed by it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be ready for unexpected meetups.</strong>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000 The maze lives \u2014 twisting with new dangers. You might face bunch of creepy events: collapsing floors, sudden traps, ghosts flying around and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Is everything as clear as you think.</strong>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000 As you move forward you will discover the secrets buried deep beyond the con maze and the basement.\u00a0Each area holds its own hidden truth \u2014 left behind, covered up, or never meant to be found. Answers don\u2019t come easy, and not everything will make sense. But the further you go, the harder it gets to ignore that something is very wrong.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672820/extras/e4f62eb15ccdb5e9d6572129d391c70d.webp?t=1745521359\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No one\u2019s ever found the way out \u2014 at least, none that lived to speak of it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay sharp, don\u2019t trust what feels familiar, and never slow down \u2014 the maze watches in silence, the basement remembers,</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672820/extras/fecbf9b5ed41bb8445b65e8301db70a4.webp?t=1745521359\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GleanBound</strong>: is first-person horror semi-realistic maze runner that mixes adrenaline-fueled chase mechanics with  creepy events and terrifying creatures. Collect soul stones and stay ahead of what\u2019s hunting you \u2014 but remember, every corner could be your last. Run and uncover the dark secret that put you there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672820/extras/f65ff5f1034e361e6b9fcdc3cf0f2e0d.poster.avif?t=1745521359\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672820/extras/f65ff5f1034e361e6b9fcdc3cf0f2e0d.webm?t=1745521359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672820/extras/84d627f721a2e7b1694ed6a666acb6e1.webp?t=1745521359\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world may not be fully real, but it <i>feels</i> disturbingly close.</strong>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000 The corn maze breathes with eerie atmosphere \u2014 rustling leaves, distant footsteps, flickers in the dark.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The basement reeks of decay \u2014 rotting wood, rusted tools, and walls clawed bare through torn, moldy wallpaper. Dust chokes the air, light barely reaches the corners.</p>